This archive has one folder with two chained LZMA2 coders, which
libarchive doesn't support. It was created with 7-Zip 26.04:

echo hello > file1
7zz a -m0=LZMA2 -m1=LZMA2 -mhc=off -mtm=off -mtc=off -mta=off \
    test_read_format_7zip_chained_lzma2.7z file1

